          "name": "Romanian Deadlift",
          "sets": 3,
          "reps": "6-10",
          "rest": 120,
          "type": "reps",
          "notes": "Main hinge movement. Brace, maintain ribs stacked over pelvis, push hips back and keep the weight close."
        },
        {
          "id": "d-02",
